{"id": "3207941", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3207941", "title": "Transylvania Open 2025 \u2013 Dublu", "text": "Transylvania Open 2025 \u2013 Dublu a avut loc \u00een prima jum\u0103tate a lunii februarie 2025. \u0218aisprezece perechi de juc\u0103toare s-au \u00eenscris \u00een competi\u021bia de dublu a turneului de tenis de la Cluj-Napoca, Rom\u00e2nia, jucat pe terenuri cu suprafa\u021b\u0103 dur\u0103. Caty McNally \u0219i Asia Muhammad au fost campioanele \u00een exerci\u021biu, dar McNally a ales s\u0103 nu participe, iar Muhammad a ales s\u0103 concureze \u00een schimb la Abu Dhabi Open.\nMagali Kempen \u0219i Anna Siskov\u00e1 au c\u00e2\u0219tigat titlul de dublu la Transylvania Open 2025, \u00eenving\u00e2nd \u00een final\u0103 perechea Jaqueline Cristian \u0219i Angelica Moratelli cu 6\u20133, 6\u20131."}
