{"id": "3208132", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3208132", "title": "Abu Dhabi Open 2025 \u2013 Dublu", "text": "Abu Dhabi Open 2025 \u2013 Dublu a avut loc \u00een prima jum\u0103tate a lunii februarie 2025. \u0218aisprezece perechi de juc\u0103toare s-au \u00eenscris \u00een competi\u021bia de dublu a turneului de tenis de la Abu Dhabi disputat pe terenuri cu suprafa\u021b\u0103 dur\u0103. Sofia Kenin \u0219i Bethanie Mattek-Sands au fost campioanele \u00een exerci\u021biu, dar au ales s\u0103 nu participe \u00eempreun\u0103 \u00een acest an. Kenin a f\u0103cut pereche cu Magda Linette, dar a pierdut \u00een prima rund\u0103 \u00een fa\u021ba Laurei Samson \u0219i a Mark\u00e9tei Vondrou\u0161ov\u00e1. Mattek-Sands au fost partenere cu Lucie \u0160af\u00e1\u0159ov\u00e1, dar au pierdut \u00een prima rund\u0103 \u00een fa\u021ba Luisa Stefani \u0219i Heather Watson.\nJe\u013cena Ostapenko \u0219i Ellen Perez au c\u00e2\u0219tigat titlul la dublu la Abu Dhabi Open 2025, \u00eenving\u00e2ndu-le \u00een final\u0103 pe Kristina Mladenovic \u0219i Zhang Shuai, cu6\u20132, 6\u20131."}
